## Quick start

### Server

```bash
cd server
uv sync
uv run python manage.py migrate
uv run python manage.py runserver {{ bind_ip }}:{{ server_port }}
```

### Client

```bash
cd client
pnpm install
pnpm dev
```

## Notes

- Server config is loaded from `server/config.toml` + `server/config.local.toml`.
- Client Vite config is composed from `@arrai-innovations/vueda/vite`.

